<title>UK: Samsung plans 12 bln yen 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Samsung plans 12 bln yen 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Samsung Co Ltd unit was expected to launch a 12 billion yen three-year bond on Wednesday, syndicate managers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Issued by Samsung Trading, the paper will be guaranteed by Samsung Co. The deal will be the Korean company's first fixed-rate yen transaction, they said.</p>
<p>Nomura was tipped to act as lead manager.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
